Renia watched the portal close as her father fell to Zanarak. Grief hardened into a promise.
Renia: I will kill him. I will take Gerano back.
Vera: Tyran's last order was to get you to Lord Hanlar in Novaras. We must go.
Karak stayed beside Renia as she broke down, unable to offer anything but his hand.
[end_timeline]
